----------------------------

This tool queries public endpoints and structured search feeds for TripAdvisor
data at runtime. The terms of that service remain with TripAdvisor and its
respective content providers, and are not granted by the license above. The AGPL
covers the source code in this repository; it does not grant rights to third-party
copyrighted listings, user review texts, or photographs fetched at runtime.

This project redistributes no scraped listing dataset and ships no harvested review
catalogue. All intelligence extraction and reasoning are performed dynamically
and cached locally on the user's system in SQLite.
